    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature within 2 squares (triggered when the thrall is bloodied) rolls <strong>Guard</strong> vs DC 12. Hit: <code>1d8</code> kinetic (vow-burst) + violence; half on success. The thrall plants their feet. Failed-save targets are knocked prone and pushed 1 square away. The thrall cannot be moved by any means until the end of their next turn.<br/><em>1 per Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>There is no second-to-last stand. There is only this one.</em></p>",
